            <div xml:id="d355">

                <pb facs="0642" n="510" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg510"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    Truman Papers</note>
                <head>No. 355<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Note by the President’s Chief of
                        Staff</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Leahy</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d355-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1945-07-01T23:59:59-04:00"
                            notBefore="1945-06-19T00:00:00-04:00">Undated</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Flooded Lands in Holland</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Propose that the Reparations Commission be directed to recommend the temporary
                    occupation by Holland of an acreage of contiguous agricultural land equal in area to the agricultural
                        land inundated by salt water by
                    German action during the occupation of Holland by German forces.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
